# Sample media IS uploaded: it is gitignored so it never enters the repo, but a
# demo deploy needs something to play. Delete this file's exception and set
# VIDEO_PROVIDER=r2 for anything real.
#
# The parent directory is gitignored (.gitignore:26 `public/media`), so a bare
# `!public/media` re-includes only the directory entry, not its children — git's
# "cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded" rule. Both lines are
# needed: the first re-opens the directory, the second re-includes its
# contents. Verified necessary after media 404'd on a CLI deploy.
!public/media/
!public/media/**
